              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Ne’arim Chariot have Driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, bow, javelins, light armour and shield. Option: may have thrusting spears (+6 points). Light Chariots. Expert Horsemen. Sherden Guard have Hand weapon and buckler. Option: may have javelins (+1 point) and light armour (+2 points). Stubborn. Sea Peoples have Hand weapon, javelins and shield Option: May have light armour (+2 points). Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Libyans &amp; Kushites Hand weapon and javelins. Light Infantry. Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Syrians Hand weapon and javelins. Option: May have short bows (+1 point) or bows (+2 point). Light Infantry. Numbians Hand weapon and short bow. Skirmishers. Slingers Hand weapon and sling. Option: May have buckler (free) Skirmishers.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="79bf-e625-b28d-9f65" name="Allies and Mercenaries (Unreliable)" hidden="false" targetId="6e8f-14cf-a018-5d1c" type="rule"/>
