  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="b91c-0847-96ef-5f4f" name="New Kingdom Egyptian (AoA2) - List Notes" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF ANTIQUITY v2 #114 (unofficial, Martin Gibbins). The Egypt everyone remembers, covering the major wars against the Hittites and the sea peoples. 

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[New Kingdom Egyptian]
  Allies and Mercenaries: up to 25%
  Characters: up to 25%
  Chariots and Cavalry: up to 40%
  Infantry: at least 25%
  Characters: up to 25% Chariots and Cavalry: up to 40% Infantry: At least 25% Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 25%</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
